  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAADP MDTF Common Market for Eastern and Southern Africa (COMESA) Child Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The original objective of the Project was to improve strategic planning and implementation of agricultural investments at national and regional levels. The grant&#x2019;s PDO and results framework were restructured as part of the additional financing.  The revised PDO is &#x201c;improved enabling environment for African agricultural programs and policies at national and regional level.&#x201d;</narrative>
  </description>
